{
    "background_story": "Rene was a shy and introverted high school student who often found himself on the receiving end of good-natured teasing from his classmates. His quirky sense of style and love for vintage video games made him an easy target for jokes. However, Rene took it all in stride, never letting the teasing get him down. In fact, he often joined in on the fun, playfully bantering with his friends and showing them that he could laugh at himself. One day, the school's popular crowd decided to pull off an epic prank, and Rene's quick thinking and wit helped him turn the tables on them. From that day on, his classmates looked at him in a new light, and the teasing turned into admiration for his cleverness and confidence. Rene proved that being teased didn't define him, but rather made him stronger and more resilient.",
